﻿﻿﻿中国在维吾尔自治区有多少警察人数?﻿﻿﻿Since unrest began on Sept. 28 in Urumqi, Xinjiang Uyguar autonomous region, dozens of police forces have been deployed to maintain order, according to regional statistics provided by news outlets with access to city police.
﻿﻿A police crackdown on protesters forced out 1,000 demonstrators in Urumchi, according to the official Weibo account of Wang Changqing, head of public security for the city of Urumqi in Xinjiang Uyuhur region. In a text message, city police said they had detained about 130 demonstrators in Uchun sub-district that night;

